   "source": [
    "## KF Failure Modes — Layer-accumulated (per species)\n",
    "\n",
    "Sum across all kept layers (respects `SKIP_VOLUMES` / `SKIP_LAYERS`) to give the total per-particle failure rate vs $p_T$.\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Mode 1 (holes):** $\\sum_\\ell \\text{holes}_\\ell\\,/\\,N_\\text{tot}$ — average number of holes per GT particle.\n",
    "- **Mode 2 (missed layers):** $\\sum_\\ell \\text{miss\\_num}_\\ell\\,/\\,\\sum_\\ell \\text{miss\\_den}_\\ell$ — pooled probability that a truth-hit layer was missed.\n",
    "\n",
    "Both UNMATCHED-only and ALL-GT views are shown side-by-side.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
